<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 17.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/94    100/101    UNQ    164/166</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  96/98    102/103  175/177  184/186</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker levels held steady on Tuesday despite few enquiries, traders said. As demand from shipowners was poor and some buyers were asking for very low prices, many suppliers said they preferred to stay on the sidelines.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
